### GET /openapi.json, hours set: paths and description
paths: ["/bookings","/bookings/{booking_id}","/availability"]
Request a table at Cafe A. No sign-in.

How it works:
1. POST /bookings with the diner's details. The answer has a `confirm_code` and a `confirm_url` (a WhatsApp link).
2. The diner opens `confirm_url` and sends the prefilled message from THE SAME phone number as `phone`, within 30 minutes (`expires_at`).
   Until then the request is not sent to the restaurant. A code sent from another number does nothing.
3. The restaurant then accepts or declines it, and tells the diner on WhatsApp.
   Poll GET /bookings/{booking_id} with the `X-Booking-Status-Token` header to follow it.

At most 3 open requests per phone number at a time (unconfirmed, or confirmed by the diner and waiting for the restaurant). Send an Idempotency-Key header to retry safely.

Booking rules: Diners can book Tue–Sun 午市 12:00–14:00 and 晚市 18:00–21:30, every 30 minutes, 2 hours to 30 days ahead, up to 8 people. Closed: 25 Nov (冬至). Tables are for 2 hours.
Call GET /availability first: it lists the open dates and the times the restaurant takes; only those times are accepted.
A request outside the rules gets 400 invalid_request with per-field codes in `fields` (date: closed_day; time: outside_hours, too_soon or too_far; accept_terms: terms_required) and up to 3 `suggested_times` ({date, time}, nearest first) the restaurant does take: offer those to the diner.

Booking terms: show these booking terms to the diner and get their agreement BEFORE you call POST /bookings, then send `accept_terms: true` (without it the request is refused with accept_terms: terms_required).
訂座須知: 訂座保留 15 分鐘。
Terms: Tables are held for 15 minutes.

Collection statement: The details you submit (date, time, party size, name, phone number and notes) go only to Cafe A, to handle this booking. Privacy policy: https://ohmyclient.io/privacy-policy.html
收集個人資料聲明: 你提交的資料(日期、時間、人數、姓名、電話號碼及備註)只會交給Cafe A,用作處理今次訂座。 私隱政策: https://ohmyclient.io/privacy-policy.html

